			<div class="content" id="post-content-4064148">
									

<p>Thanks a lot to wctaiwan, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oakfeather" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4892550); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4892550&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1543637798" alt="Oakfeather" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4892550)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oakfeather" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4892550); return false;">Oakfeather</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mayoculpa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3489662); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3489662&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1543637798" alt="mayoculpa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3489662)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mayoculpa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3489662); return false;">mayoculpa</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1543637798" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;">DarkStuff</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fieldstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1436137); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1436137&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1543637798" alt="fieldstone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1436137)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fieldstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1436137); return false;">fieldstone</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apn123" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2345178); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2345178&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1543637798" alt="apn123" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2345178)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apn123" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2345178); return false;">apn123</a></span> for looking at my drafts. <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/t-7504315/the-attribute-pen">The drafts and critiques forum thread</a> doesn't have all of the reviews, as some were conducted over IRC and were not transcribed.</p>
<p>I drew a lot of inspiration from <a href="http://ansuz.sooke.bc.ca/entry/23">&quot;What colour are your bits?&quot;</a> and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nzj7Wg4DAbs">&quot;Why humans run the world | Yuval Noah Harari&quot;</a>. The immaterial world humans mutually create and live in is very powerful despite its artificiality, and I hoped to give a taste of the danger that lies in being able to hijack it.</p>
<p>The image was an original creation by me. It is available under the same Creative Commons terms as the text.</p>

